    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33756" root="فره" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفْرِهٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفْرِهَةٌ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفَرِّهَةٌ</span> (S) are epithets
applied to a she-camel, meaning <i>Bringing forth</i>
[<i>young ones such as are termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْهٌ</span> (S) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرَّهٌ</span>.
(K.) [See 4.]

